            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This application discloses a secondary battery, and a battery module, a battery pack and an apparatus containing the secondary battery. The secondary battery has a positive and negative electrodes having specific positive and negative active materials respectively, such that the secondary battery may have improved dynamic performance and at the same time have better cycle performance at high temperature and safety performance.</p>
            </abstract>
